flowchart TD
    source[Permitted original evidence] --> derived[Source-linked derived knowledge]
    source --> observed[Observed task outcome]
    derived --> query[Scoped query and direct-source verification]
    observed --> candidate[Inactive project-learning candidate]
    candidate --> approval[Evidence and explicit promotion approval]
    approval --> lesson[Scoped accepted guidance]
    lesson --> review[Version, applicability and counterexample review]
    review -->|Changed or contradicted| quarantine[Quarantine, supersede or retire]
    review -->|Still applicable| lesson
    derived --> lint[Bounded structural lint and semantic review]
    lint -->|Affected sources only| derived
    lesson --> proposal[Bounded shared-skill improvement proposal]
    proposal --> qualification[Separate approval; tests; host qualification; rollback]
    qualification --> policy[Maintained canonical skill]
    authority[Externally enforced authority] -. Governs every write and action .-> qualification
    authority -. Knowledge cannot rewrite policy .-> derived
